      "date": "2026-09-11 23:02:08.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(1 comment)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nThe ordering fix itself looks right: the receive tuple is written before smp_store_release() of ksnc_rx_state, and the only lockless reader now pairs with smp_load_acquire(). The other entry into ksocknal_process_receive() (the PARSE_WAIT requeue) is already ordered by the kss_lock release/acquire handoff, so nothing else looks like it needs a barrier. Fine to land; one optional commit-message accuracy note inline for whenever it is next refreshed.",
      "accounts_in_message": [],
      "_revision_number": 1
    },
